WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.354
Today we will connect the form of a useful object to its function. Our work connects

00:00:05.354 --> 00:00:06.643
with other Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.650
Observe the pot rim, body, base and any decoration.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.031
Draw the outline using simple curved lines.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:20.175
Add a label showing how the pot might be used. Compare your result with a second

00:00:20.175 --> 00:00:21.061
example from Ghana.
